  _headline: "Rodovi\xE1rios param e a cidade n\xE3o chega ao trabalho"
  _headlineEn: Transit workers strike; nobody gets to work
  _body: "Sem \xF4nibus, trabalhadores e mercadorias n\xE3o circulam. A prefeitura
    abriu negocia\xE7\xE3o, e seu Arnaldo n\xE3o deu conta das corridas."
  _bodyEn: Without buses, workers and goods can't move. City Hall opened talks, and
    Arnaldo couldn't keep up with the rides.
